**5 pricing traps covered:**
1. Basis of Award anchor — discounting commercially can expose GSA rates
2. Price Reduction Clause — every better deal anywhere triggers a matching obligation
3. Vague unit pricing — "discounted from catalog" stalls contracting officers
4. Competitive benchmark gap — GSA rates are public; competitors can see them
5. No escalation clause — absorbing year-4 costs at year-1 rates

